  "faq": {
    "tab_title": "FAQ",
    "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "subtitle": "Everything you need to know about STUDER — from blocks and courses to contests and data privacy.",
    "what_is_q": "What is STUDER?",
    "what_is_a": "STUDER is a collaborative educational platform where you can create, share, and learn from educational blocks and courses. Anyone can contribute knowledge and build learning paths.",
    "free_q": "Is STUDER free?",
    "free_a": "Yes. STUDER is completely free. There are no payments, subscriptions, or premium features. The entire platform is open to everyone.",
    "age_q": "Is there an age requirement?",
    "age_a": "You must be at least 13 years old to create an account on STUDER.",
    "blocks_q": "What are blocks?",
    "blocks_a": "Blocks are the fundamental unit of knowledge in STUDER. Each block is an independent, reusable educational resource that can contain text, images, videos, interactive activities, and more. Blocks can be versioned and forked to promote collaborative improvement.",
    "courses_q": "What are courses?",
    "courses_a": "Courses are collections of blocks arranged in a specific order to form a learning path. You can create courses with your own blocks or combine blocks from other users.",
    "contests_q": "What are contests?",
    "contests_a": "Contests are time-limited events where the community creates and evaluates educational content around a specific theme. During a contest, courses are hidden from public view and evaluated anonymously by participants. When the contest ends, the best content is published to the platform.",
    "moderation_q": "Is there content moderation?",
    "moderation_a": "STUDER is a self-moderated community. We rely on users to report inappropriate content. There is no centralized moderation team. By using the platform, you agree to respect other users and contribute responsibly.",
    "data_q": "How is my data handled?",
    "data_a": "We collect only the data necessary for the platform to function (username, email, educational content). Your data is stored securely and is never shared with third parties. See our Terms and Conditions for full details.",
    "delete_q": "How can I delete my account?",
    "delete_a": "You can request full deletion of your account and all associated data at any time. Contact support through the platform or email us with your username for immediate processing."
  },
